      |                            |--------------------------->|
      |  202 Accepted              |                            |
      |&lt;---------------------------|                            |
      |                            |                            |
      |     ...mail delivered, signed URL enclosed...           |
      |                            |                            |
      |  GET /cv/&#123;token&#125;           |                            |
      |--------------------------->|  CONSUME token             |
      |                            |--------------------------->|
      |  200 application/pdf       |          ok, burn          |
      |&lt;---------------------------|&lt;---------------------------|
      |                            |                            |
      |  GET /cv/&#123;token&#125;   (again) |                            |
      |--------------------------->|  CONSUME token             |
      |                            |--------------------------->|
      |  410 Gone                  |         already burned     |
      |&lt;---------------------------|&lt;---------------------------|
</pre>
      <figcaption>Figure 1: résumé issuance. The token is the capability. The PDF is never addressable
      without one, and never sits in a public bucket.</figcaption>
