      <tr><td class="hd" data-l="Resource"><a href="/errata.xml">/errata.xml</a></td><td data-l="Contents">Atom. Corrections, downgrades and retractions only. Subscribe to this one if you want to know whether I can be trusted, rather than what I think this week.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="hd" data-l="Resource"><a href="/revisions.xml">/revisions.xml</a></td><td data-l="Contents">Atom. Every substantive edit to an existing paper, with a diff summary.</td></tr>
